  "notes": "Competitive research screen on shared six-slot capture-bank quiet-drop rules, not Classic. Candidate has no node cap; candidateMillis null means uncapped time. Fairy has 100ms per move, one thread, 16MiB hash, NNUE off. Unequal-budget results do not establish equal-time superiority. Fixed colors and recorded tie seeds; repeated starts are correlated. Root legal parity checked every move; full history supplied. Requested depth counts plies, quiescence/reductions make this selective search. Proven mates may finish before requested depth. Every attempt is retained, not just successful screens. A successful screen requires a separate frozen confirmation schedule."
